                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In the current implementation both spark and spark2 uses spark interpreter,  both phoenix and hive uses jdbc interpreter log file. &lt;/p&gt;

